			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody"><span style="text-decoration: underline"><span style="font-weight: bold">Guild history and why i left ~ only what i can remember</span></span>
<br />

<br />
<span style="font-weight: bold">URF</span> - unstoppable rebal force I was about lvl 10 or so? everyone else was 65
<br />

<br />
<span style="font-weight: bold">Order Of Thought</span> - forever till about mid 50s
<br />

<br />
<span style="font-weight: bold">VD</span> - went there to be with OOT friends typed /guildr when trying to talk to riverblade and then never seemed to be an officer on when i was. old friends from order of thought went there but have returned to OOT.
<br />

<br />
<span style="font-weight: bold">Order of the Black Dragons</span> - Ranger trailboss kept inviting me and said stay till you make your guild. To many ideas for a guild, lots of them dumb, but one name I really liked. Or maybe bring back Nomadic Kings.
<br />

<br />
Wandered guildless till the event in gd which ill explain laters.
<br />
GD lead me to join PC.
<br />

<br />
<span style="font-weight: bold">Population Control</span> - I got booted 8(
<br />
I made pk pally Crimson cry so he booted me cuz he can.
<br />
Also Leyios the ranger still might hate Ansury cuz I killed him but im sure he forgot about that embarrassment as soon as he could.
<br />

<br />
<span style="font-weight: bold">Souls of Arcana</span> - officer had me targeted instead of person she was inviting so im hanging with them and helping their shammy with epic and just chillin.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
<span style="text-decoration: underline"><span style="font-weight: bold">GD stuff</span></span>
<br />
I was watching a fight go down in gd. Only the pk monk was in range but me and him kinda knew eachother. I was lfg and he invited me to duo with him in burning woods.
<br />

<br />
I was planning on going to CC for velium or kael for faction. I asked the halfling druid cricusfreak or something like for sow. He asked if i was sk, after a pause from looking and going LD i said zerker. He asked if i was pk I said anti then he proceeded to atk me. After ten resist or so I got mad and hit the him pretty hard. After chasing him off more came at me and I went running around and threw some of them.
<br />

<br />
When that stuff went down with that druid the antis were all on me. The monks buds showed up and you know the saying the enemy of my enemy is my friend.
<br />

<br />
A necro from order of thought was in their guild and said it would be nice if i joined that we could hang out together and stuff. They rubbed my ego the right way and I figured what the hell might as well try it and see what comes of it.
<br />

<br />

<br />
<span style="text-decoration: underline"><span style="font-weight: bold">About PC and me getting booted</span></span>
<br />
They tend to talk alot of trash. I usually dont say much but figured might as well try to fit in. So i started talking a bit of trash which would lead to a bit of pvp fun with eachother. It was fun smacking them around with my big axe. But i guess i talked to much trash to the pally who wanted to dual, and i would of to but since he kicked me from guild i said screw him and went to hang with ruealta/gueze an old bud who I havent seen in ages.
<br />

<br />
<span style="text-decoration: underline"><span style="font-weight: bold">SoA in ef</span></span>
<br />
Then the things with Souls of Arcana im in an anti guild again and there was fun in ef. Just got outta a adv and was with some other antis going to kill off the pkers. Warrior charged head first into the battle and got smote, the sk ogre and troll with us got pushed out and had a guild wizzy comming for some action. I ran screaming like a sissy, on the inside, dotted bad with splurt and some other poisons. I kicked in my regen and sat and lived . I forget who else went in with us but he died from the poisons. We regrouped and sk had a plan, and we ran in together focused on the healers and then next on down the list and killed em all 1 by 1 by 1. They all tried to go ld so we wouldnt get any points and it work. Tho we got thier loot instead.  Was alot of PC there that we killed, and a ton of FOH all green tho.<div style="vertical-align: bottom"><br /><br /></div></span><span class="gensmall"></span></td>
