<br />

<br />
Aeternus Consilium 2004-05-02 19:29 - Drunken Warlord kinda broke up a bit. sad that guilds with such great names have trouble keeping it together
<br />

<br />
most of AC went to TBS i was thinking of heading to mercs to hang with khank but guildless im kinda free to roam norrath or any other place i can squirm into. BTW for ur info squirming into places isn't good if u got a fat head. Take it from one who knows, you get stuck a whole lot more then you should by squirming into places then looking and walking on by.
<br />

<br />

<br />
I would like to get into CotW, im close to the requirements, maybe missing a shard not sure tho.
<br />

<br />
  Ill tell you one thing i always wanted to do since i was a young warrior and that be a zerker. Either going crazy with 2 weapons that proced like mad or just  crushing, smashing and hacking crazy-like threw my enemy. Warriors are expected to tank and running around like that might drive some people mad. That has kept Ansury from being a zerker most of the time. Only wish my zerker could crippling blow at low health like a warrior.
<br />

<br />
  Guess im just repeating what Sriani told me, that you guys dont need another warrior, but u don't got any zerker either. So if I got in the guild and had to choose only one i would probly say the zerker. I get all the dps aas of a warrior cept the 2 weapon ones i only get to use a big 2hander which is the other way i woulda went with Ansury the warzerker.
<br />

<br />
Zerker frenzy is a nice added boost for dps and the insta stuns and snares are good in groups too.
<br />

<br />
Just letting ya know that cuz both are on the same account and i cant 2box em. Almost all my playing time now goes to the zerker as well. I see no point in having both mains in the guild.
<br />

<br />
